;; Spike S4: a renderer-like Seatbelt profile.
;;
;; Everything is denied, then the profile allows only what a sandboxed
;; renderer needs once it is running: the broker's rendezvous service, named
;; by the RENDEZVOUS parameter. Anything else a helper uses must already be
;; open when the profile is applied (sandbox(7): restrictions apply when a
;; resource is acquired), such as its inherited socket and standard output.
(version 1)
(deny default)

(allow mach-lookup (global-name (param "RENDEZVOUS")))
